OL,3,GNEWSACity's bid to get carbon zero
OL,4,Atargets back on track
OL,5,
OL,6,FA raft of environmental projects are in
OL,7,Fthe pipeline amid concerns about a
OL,8,Fcity's slower-than-hoped progress in
OL,9,Fachieving "carbon zero" status by 2038.
OL,11,FClimate change projects worth #100m are
OL,12,Fbeing planned in Manchester in a bid to
OL,13,Fslash emissions and boost its green
OL,14,Fcredentials.
OL,16,FMaking Manchester a Net Zero city is
OL,17,Fexpected to cost billions overall, with
OL,18,Finvestment needed from both public and
OL,19,Fprivate organisations.
